What changed:
- Added `--download-assets` / `--no-download-assets`, defaulting off.
- Added REST image export/download flow using `/v1/images/{file_key}` with `format=svg|png` and `scale=1`.
- Saves vectors to `{output}/{section}/vectors/{id_safe}.svg` and image fills to `{output}/{section}/images/{image_ref}.png`.
- Manifest entries get `local_path`, `format`, and actual file SHA-256 only when download succeeds.
- API/download failures warn and fall back to metadata-only manifest entries without exiting nonzero.
- Added 429 backoff `1s -> 2s -> 4s`, 10MB asset cap, and deterministic manifest behavior.
- Updated validator so downloaded manifests validate by `local_path`/file-hash shape while old manifests still validate by metadata hash.

